# Feefo

> Feefo is a verified reviews platform. All reviews are collected from confirmed customer transactions.

## Review pages

Merchant review pages:
https://www.feefo.com/en-GB/reviews/*

Product review pages:
https://www.feefo.com/en-GB/reviews/*/products/*

Individual review pages:
https://www.feefo.com/en-GB/reviews/*/customer-review-*

## Structured data

Pages include Schema.org JSON-LD covering Product, Review, AggregateRating,
Organization, BreadcrumbList, ImageObject, and VideoObject entities.